 "remarks": "Move in to New Canaan and enjoy the benefit of this wonderful town and schools. Live in one unit and also own an exceptional investment opportunity in the heart of New Canaan. This fully leased, income-producing property offers immediate cash flow and long-term value in one of Fairfield County's most desirable communities. Generating an additional $6000 per month in rental income from the other leased rental units and garages, this property is an affordable and savvy alternative to higher priced homes and provides access to all the town has to offer. This rare offering includes a total of 3 units and 6 garages-4 attached to the main residence plus a detached 2-car garage with loft storage-providing additional rental potential, storage, or future flexibility. The charming grounds feature a delightful garden setting, creating an appealing environment for residents. Ideally located within walking distance to New Canaan's vibrant downtown, residents enjoy easy access to fine dining, boutique shopping, parks, cultural attractions, and the Metro-North train with direct service to Grand Central Terminal. Consistently recognized for its #1 top-rated schools, picturesque New England character, and exceptional quality of life, New Canaan remains one of Connecticut's most sought-after residential destinations.",
